<title>ISRAEL: Christopher meets Arafat in Gaza.</title>
<headline>Christopher meets Arafat in Gaza.</headline>
<dateline>BEIT HANOUN, Gaza Strip 1996-10-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. Secretary of State Warren Christopher met Palestinian President Yasser Arafat in the Gaza Strip on Sunday after urging Israel and the PLO to achieve results quickly at talks later in the day.</p>
<p>Christopher and Arafat made no comments to reporters before beginning their discussions, an hour before Israel and the PLO were due to resume U.S.-brokered peace talks.</p>
